Identifying Malicious Attachments & URLs
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Analyze email attachments for malicious characteristics using Python
Implement automated URL scanning to detect phishing and malware distribution sites
Calculate file hashes and identify suspicious file properties
Apply risk scoring methodologies to security threats
Generate comprehensive security reports
Prerequisites
Basic Python programming knowledge
Familiarity with Linux command line
Understanding of file systems and file types
Basic cybersecurity concepts (malware, phishing)
Lab Environment
Al Nafi Cloud Machine: Click Start Lab to access your pre-configured Ubuntu Linux environment with Python 3.x and required libraries pre-installed.

