Troubleshooting Tips
Import errors: Ensure all required libraries are installed using pip3

Permission denied: Use chmod +x on Python scripts to make them executable

Magic library errors: Install libmagic: sudo apt install libmagic1 python3-magic

Network timeouts: Increase timeout values in requests.get() calls or check internet connectivity

File not found: Verify file paths are correct and files exist before scanning

